    "detailed_description": "<h1>Pre orders Get Updates for free</h1><p>If you pre order the game all updates, new characters, character addons, and customizations added will be given for free as thank you for your support. We are not a huge company or studio and every dollar helps as appreciation for helping me i give back to you. thank you again for your support.</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>&quot;HXH: Battle All One&quot; is an exciting fighting game that allows players to experience intense boss like battles and utilize unique abilities of each character. Players can choose from a variety of characters, each with their own distinctive fighting styles and special moves.\r\n\r\nThe game's mechanics are fast-paced and action-packed, with intuitive controls that allow players to unleash devastating combos and powerful special attacks. In addition to the traditional versus mode, &quot;HXH: Battle All One&quot; also features a story mode that follows the events of a anime and manga series coming soon, as well as a survival mode where players must battle increasingly difficult opponents to see how long they can last.\r\n\r\nOne of the standout features of &quot;HXH: Battle All One&quot; is the unique &quot;magic/kai&quot; system, which allows players to unleash powerful special abilities based on their characters' individual strengths and weaknesses. By mastering the magic/kai system, players can create devastating combinations of attacks that can turn the tide of even the toughest battles.\r\n\r\nOverall, &quot;HXH: Battle All One&quot; is a must-play for fighting game enthusiasts. With its thrilling battles, diverse cast of characters, and innovative gameplay mechanics, this game offers endless hours of entertainment for players of all skill levels.",
